# Vendored Wycheproof corpus is hash-pinned by wycheproof_vectors/manifest.json
# (per-file SHA-256).  The runner hashes the raw checked-out bytes, so any
# end-of-line conversion changes the digest and fails the gate on platforms
# whose checkout default is CRLF (Windows).  Mark the corpus and its manifest
# as non-text so git performs no smudge/clean EOL translation and the working
# tree is byte-identical to the committed blob on every platform.
/wycheproof_vectors/vectors/*.json -text
/wycheproof_vectors/manifest.json -text
